et's say today's screenshot differed  dramatically from yesterday's um i think  this this was a thing that was like sort  of half-heartedly attempted and then we  dropped it because the the time  the time trade-off wasn't worth it just  given the structure of the organization  and but yeah that that was another thing  that ended up being  kind of sort of manual  uh thank you so much julia for taking  the time to present to us today and  thanks for being part of pi data global  2021.  thank you
 

